<p>You call upon an eerie night to aid you for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 7, 8</acronym> turns.</p><p>Each turn you automatically fire a beam of darkness towards a random foe (prioritizing the ones further away) that deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">102, 138, 165, 188, 209</acronym> darkness damage and has 25% chance to blind any foes caught inside for 4 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>